[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5703.83, "timestamp": "01:35:03", "text": "游戏。说实话，这游戏太可爱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5705.149, "timestamp": "01:35:05", "text": "但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5710.83, "timestamp": "01:35:10", "text": "这种疼痛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5714.84, "timestamp": "01:35:14", "text": "世界。我想念维生素B12"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5716.51, "timestamp": "01:35:16", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5720.149, "timestamp": "01:35:20", "text": "已经。我唯一感觉到的就是这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5724.95, "timestamp": "01:35:24", "text": "令人遗憾的是维生素B12的消亡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5729.03, "timestamp": "01:35:29", "text": "所有人都还活着。克莱姆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5731.07, "timestamp": "01:35:31", "text": "呃，克莱门汀是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5736.95, "timestamp": "01:35:36", "text": "活。呃，我在剪辑里看到了Momo。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5740.669, "timestamp": "01:35:40", "text": "场景。他们俩都在场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5744.31, "timestamp": "01:35:44", "text": "是的，医生。我也见到了Doc。没看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5746.27, "timestamp": "01:35:46", "text": "另一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5750.79, "timestamp": "01:35:50", "text": "男。那个名字以S开头的家伙"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5753.669, "timestamp": "01:35:53", "text": "它连接了很多电视机之类的设备。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5756.229, "timestamp": "01:35:56", "text": "是啊，我很好奇他后来怎么样了。"}]